      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stock snapshot\n**Runs:** Monday 04:00, after Store A sales (same Bling account, same rate limit)\n\nPages through every product in Bling (100 per page), fetches each product's details and appends `saldoVirtualTotal`, unit and `itensPorCaixa` to the `Stock` tab.\n\nWhen a page comes back empty the IF takes the **false** branch, which sends a completion e-mail and ends the run.\n\n**Test mode:** lower `maxPages` in `Set Page` to process only the first N pages.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      },
